Vectors in this repository keep the licenses of their upstreams:

- wycheproof/ — Apache License 2.0
  (https://github.com/C2SP/wycheproof/blob/master/LICENSE)
- rfc/6979-deterministic-ecdsa/, rfc/8032-eddsa/, rfc/9497-oprf/ — data
  extracted from RFC texts, subject to the IETF Trust Legal Provisions
  (https://trustee.ietf.org/documents/trust-legal-provisions/)
- rfc/9380-hash-to-curve/ — reference-implementation vectors from the CFRG
  draft repository (https://github.com/cfrg/draft-irtf-cfrg-hash-to-curve)
- rfc/9591-frost/ — MIT/Apache-2.0
  (https://github.com/ZcashFoundation/frost#license)
- acvp/ — NIST license, reproduced below.

